[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3886641384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115985#issuecomment-3886641384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115985","id":3886641384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nqXDo","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T19:43:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T19:43:44Z","body":"Hello @groud, I think you could be the right person to review this since it changes what you introduced with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78477.\r\n\r\nI believe this PR is important since it fixes random  crashes and bugs when async loading a scene containing tilesets (100% reproducible on my project).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3886641384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897518837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115985#issuecomment-3897518837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115985","id":3897518837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oT2r1","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T14:28:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T14:28:09Z","body":"I agree that the code snipped you wrote would be affected. \r\n\r\nBut what you suggest, while probably fixing the crash, will still cause an issue. Let's say the the async loading is finished and the main thread is running a script that manipulates the loaded TileSet, while there is still a second thread loading the same TileSet (which can happen due to how the multithreaded loading is implemented). So when the second thread steal the main thread TileSet's source and replace it with a duplicate, this will cause issues with the main thread script: \r\n- If the script stored a reference to the source, it will not be the right one after.\r\n- If the script did changes to the original source, maybe some will not be present on the duplicate (I don't know if all the properties are duplicated).\r\n\r\nIn the end I think it's a dangerous pattern to have a \"set_xxx\" method on an object A doing changes on another object B that can be on another thread manipulating what you are changing. I think it's ok to have set_source potentially duplicating the source you are giving while as long as it's documented in the set_source method. On the contrary, it would be much more difficult to track down the issue if a TileSet you have is suddenly changing its source...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897518837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897647262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115985#issuecomment-3897647262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115985","id":3897647262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oUWCe","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T14:54:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T14:54:37Z","body":"Hmm, I kind of dislike that then. My opinion on the matter is that users cannot really expect the internal API to duplicate the resource out of nowhere, without, at least, print an warning message or return the duplicated resource instead (something like that). But if there's no other solution I agree the current solution is fine. \r\n\r\nWhat I don't understand is how the TileSet ends up different in the multiple loads. If the TileSet is different, I assume it means it's duplicated. And in such case, then the TileSetSource should be duplicated at that time too (since the source properties have this flag: `PROPERTY_USAGE_ALWAYS_DUPLICATE`). So I wonder if there could be a duplication problem from there instead.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897647262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897799691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115985#issuecomment-3897799691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115985","id":3897799691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oU7QL","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T15:24:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T16:13:00Z","body":"Don't like it much to be honest. Ideally I would prefer set_source to fail and return the reason why, but it would be a bigger change.\r\n\r\nThe TileSet ends up in multiple loads to avoid deadlocks. To keep it simple, the rule is if a load task needs to wait for another load task that is older, we spawn a new one (and yes load the TileSet twice). So when it happens, we end with one of the two loaded TileSet being discarded (see this [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bf95b62586e31b8a3503f5903d7764d7c52bf2ab/core/io/resource_loader.cpp#L865)). So the TileSet itself isn't duplicated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897799691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3944934553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115985#issuecomment-3944934553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115985","id":3944934553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rIuyZ","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T13:57:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T13:57:43Z","body":"@groud do you need any more information?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3944934553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]